# Machine-learning and computer-vision runtime, minus everything Blender
# needs. The audio branch's 12-ml.list also removes Embree, Imath, OpenColorIO,
# OpenEXR, OpenImageIO, OpenVDB and OpenXR; those are direct Blender
# dependencies and must stay on a video workstation.
#
# Keep out of this list: libembree4-4, libimath-3-1-29t64,
# libopencolorio2.5, libopenexr-3-4-33, libopenimageio2.5,
# libopenvdb10.0t64, libopenxr-loader1, and every libopencv-* package: MLT
# and OpenImageIO depend on the OpenCV stack through libmlt7 and Blender.
opencv-data
libtensorflow-lite2.14.1
libonnx1l
libonnxruntime-providers
libonnxruntime1.23
libxnnpack0.20241108
libdnnl3.6
libopenni2-0
